#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A course for leadership of quantum projects, describing common and best "
"practices."
msgstr ""
"Isang kurso para sa pamumuno ng mga quantum project, na naglalarawan ng mga "
"karaniwang gawi at pinakamahusay na kasanayan."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-"
"projects/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-"
"projects/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is designed to assist teams and organizations to effectively "
"build the necessary capabilities to successfully kick-start quantum "
"initiatives. \n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay dinisenyo para tulungan ang mga koponan at organisasyon "
"na epektibong mapaunlad ang mga kinakailangang kakayahan para matagumpay na "
"simulan ang mga quantum na inisyatibo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend devoting approximately 4 hours to completing this content, "
"depending on one's prior experience.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda naming maglaan ng humigit-kumulang 4 na oras para makumpleto "
"ang nilalamang ito, depende sa iyong naunang karanasan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Intended audience {#intended-audience}"
msgstr "Para kanino ang kursong ito {#intended-audience}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend this course for leaders and architects of quantum initiatives, "
"including academic faculty, project leaders in large enterprises, startup "
"leadership, and more. It will be of particular use to organizations new to "
"quantum computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda namin ang kursong ito para sa mga lider at arkitekto ng mga "
"quantum na inisyatibo, kabilang ang mga akademikong guro, mga lider ng "
"proyekto sa malalaking negosyo, pamumuno ng mga startup, at iba pa. Magiging"
" partikular na kapaki-pakinabang ito para sa mga organisasyong bago sa "
"quantum computing.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Inirekomendang background {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is no technical prerequisite for this course, but we recommend that "
"learners first take the [Quantum Business "
"Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations) course, which "
"is a good introduction to the quantum ecosystem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Walang teknikal na kinakailangan para sa kursong ito, ngunit inirerekomenda "
"naming kunin muna ng mga mag-aaral ang [Quantum Business "
"Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations) na kurso, na "
"isang magandang panimula sa quantum ecosystem.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have questions or concerns regarding this course, please contact the "
"IBM Quantum Learning&reg; team.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung mayroon kang mga tanong o alalahanin tungkol sa kursong ito, makipag-"
"ugnayan sa koponan ng IBM Quantum Learning&reg;.\n"
